---
// Quality Assurance & Certifications Section
---

<section class="section quality-section" id="quality">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="quality-wrapper">
      
      <!-- Left Column -->
      <div class="quality-intro reveal-left">
        <div class="tech-badge">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>QUALITY ASSURANCE & METROLOGY</span>
        </div>
        <h2>Zero-Defect Quality <span class="gradient-text">Engineering Standards</span></h2>
        <p>
          At Jecon Engineering Services Pvt Ltd, precision is validated through rigorous quality control procedures at every stage of fabrication, laser cutting, and multi-axis CNC machining.
        </p>

        <div class="quality-pillars">
          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-cyan)" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>100% CMM Verification</strong>
              <p>Dimensional tolerance reporting down to 0.001mm with calibrated probe inspection.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-orange)" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Mill Test Certificate (MTR 3.1)</strong>
              <p>Direct heat number traceability and chemical composition test sheets for all raw metals.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pillar-item">
            <div class="pillar-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-cyan)" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>ISO 9001:2015 Compliant QMS</strong>
              <p>Standard Operating Procedures (SOP), First Article Inspection (FAI) and CPK process control.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Visual QA Matrix with Animated Counters -->
      <div class="quality-cards-grid reveal-right stagger-parent">
        <div class="qa-stat-card cyber-card stagger-child">
          <div class="qa-stat-num" data-counter="99.98" data-suffix="%" data-decimals="2">99.98%</div>
          <div class="qa-stat-lbl">First Pass Yield Rate</div>
          <p>Continuous statistical process control minimizes scrap and guarantees repetitive accuracy.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="qa-stat-card cyber-card stagger-child">
          <div class="qa-stat-num" data-counter="0.005" data-prefix="±" data-suffix=" mm" data-decimals="3">±0.005 mm</div>
          <div class="qa-stat-lbl">Micron Tolerance Capability</div>
          <p>Verified on Coordinate Measuring Machine under climate-controlled 20°C standards.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="qa-stat-card cyber-card stagger-child">
          <div class="qa-stat-num" data-counter="100" data-suffix="%">100%</div>
          <div class="qa-stat-lbl">Traceable Material Certificates</div>
          <p>Every single manufactured batch is serialized and archived for lifetime customer traceability.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="qa-stat-card cyber-card stagger-child">
          <div class="qa-stat-num">ASME IX</div>
          <div class="qa-stat-lbl">Certified Welders</div>
          <p>Qualified welding procedures (WPS/PQR) for pressure boundary vessels, piping, and structures.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quality-section {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .quality-wrapper {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .quality-intro h2 {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .quality-intro p {
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .quality-pillars {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pillar-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.15rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .pillar-item:hover .pillar-icon {
    transform: scale(1.08) rotate(4deg);
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .pillar-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .pillar-item p {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Right Side Grid */
  .quality-cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .qa-stat-card {
    padding: 1.85rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .qa-stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .qa-stat-lbl {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .qa-stat-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .quality-wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .quality-cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
